#* {{RQ:Schuster Hepaticae|volume=V|page=4|text=The closest affinities of the Jubulaceae are with the Lejeuneaceae. The two families share in common: (''a'') elaters usually 1-spiral, trumpet-shaped and '''fixed''' to the capsule valves, distally{{...}}}}
