#: {{syn|en|invariable|Thesaurus:immutable}}
#: {{ant|en|variable|Thesaurus:mutable}}
#: {{ux|en|'''fixed''' assets}}
#: {{ux|en|I work '''fixed''' hours for a '''fixed''' salary.}}
