#: {{ux|en|How are you '''fixed''' for money?}}
# {{lb|en|legal|of sound}} [[record|Recorded]] on a [[permanent]] [[medium]].
#: {{ux|en|In the United States, recordings are only granted copyright protection when the sounds in the recording were '''fixed''' and first published on or after February 15, 1972.}}
# {{lb|en|dialectal|informal}} {{cap|surgically}} [[render]]ed [[sterile]] (e.g. [[spayed]], [[neutered]]{{,}} or [[castrated]]).
#: {{ux|en|a '''fixed''' tomcat}}
#: {{ux|en|the she-cat has been '''fixed'''}}
# {{cap|rigged}}; [[fraudulently]] [[prearranged]].
#: {{ux|en|The mob made a lot of money from '''fixed''' horse races.}}
#: {{ux|en|The U.S. often relied on '''fixed''' elections to keep anti-communist dictatorships in power.}}
# {{lb|en|of a [[problem]]}} {{cap|resolved}}; [[corrected]].
# {{cap|repaired}}.
#: {{syn|en|mended|patched}}
# {{lb|en|astrology}} Being one of the [[sign]]s [[Taurus]], [[Leo]], [[Scorpio]], and [[Aquarius]], associated with [[stability]], [[permanence]], and [[preservation]].
